# Private, non-code documents that happen to live in the project folder —
# financing paperwork, contracts, anything legal. Untracked is not safe: it is
# one `git add -A` from permanent, and deleting a file later does not remove it
# from history. No .docx is tracked anywhere in this repo, so the blanket
# pattern costs nothing and makes the accident structurally impossible.
private/
*.docx
